# a key let go and back within 20 ms is one press (a contact's bounce): one note (a chord: 4), not a note cut and begun again
# (the mono LEAD's crackle at a note's start and end)
wait 300
tap SAVE
wait 100
tapkey w4
wait 200
onnote 1
tap HOME
wait 100
tap REC
wait 200
key w3 down 90
wait 300
key w3 up
wait 4
key w3 down 90
wait 300
key w3 up
wait 400
tap REC
wait 200
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect events 4
# a real second press (well after): two notes
tap REC
wait 200
key w5 down 90
wait 200
key w5 up
wait 60
key w5 down 90
wait 200
key w5 up
wait 400
tap REC
wait 200
tap PLAY
wait 200
expect events 12
